    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34662" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμφύρω</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμφυλλ-άω</span></b> 
